# The build context of every image built from this repository's root, which
# today is containers/gg-toolchains/Dockerfile, the toolchains image a release
# publishes. An allowlist: everything is left out, and each path an image reads
# is re-included by name, never by a wildcard (scripts/ci/build-context.sh says
# why), with the image that reads it named beside it. The `build-context` gate
# holds every COPY source to this file.
*

# containers/gg-toolchains/Dockerfile: each arm's block copies that arm's
# version file and the installer a developer's or CI machine runs, with the
# fetch helper every installer sources, and runs the installer against that
# slice, so the versions the image installs are read from the same pins.
!/packages/gg-sandbox-cpp/cpp-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-csharp/csharp-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-java/java-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-kotlin/kotlin-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-purescript/purescript-version.sh
!/packages/gg-sandbox-purescript/spago.yaml
!/packages/gg-sandbox-swift/swift-version.sh
!/scripts/ci/fetch.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-dotnet.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-java.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-kotlin.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-purescript.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-swift.sh
!/scripts/ci/install-wasi-sdk.sh
